sequenceDiagram
    participant A1 as Agent 1<br/>Job Discovery
    participant EV as agent_events<br/>(Postgres)
    participant A4 as Agent 4<br/>dispatcher
    participant A2 as Agent 2<br/>Matching
    participant A3 as Agent 3<br/>Drafting
    participant OUT as outreach<br/>(Postgres)

    A1->>EV: insert JobCreated
    A4->>EV: claim next event (SKIP LOCKED)
    A4->>A2: deliver JobCreated
    A2->>OUT: upsert match row
    A2->>EV: insert MatchFound
    A4->>EV: mark JobCreated done
    A4->>EV: claim MatchFound
    A4->>A3: deliver MatchFound
    A3->>OUT: write draft
    A3->>EV: insert DraftReady
    A4->>EV: mark MatchFound done
    Note over A1,OUT: Every agent also writes a heartbeat to agent_runs on each loop.
